{"agent_mode": null, "bash_calls": 1, "candidate_provenance": null, "cell_seed": 1310136915127513733, "checker_exit": 0, "checker_stderr": "", "checker_stdout": "retries 503 with bounded attempts; no retry on other errors\nOBENCH_VERDICT: pass\n", "checker_workspace_files": {"README.md": {"bytes": 96, "mtime": 1792286047.5221384, "sha256": "4b6141730d2c1b7fdbc977c1575d67ebdcde4f155ea0f8014444615df7e2d1cb"}, "weather.py": {"bytes": 924, "mtime": 1792468353.9201057, "sha256": "8e98db8ceb4f164ad479c3f788205b6479769e1a5c3749d2ff542e84efcef3ae"}}, "child_edit_calls": 0, "child_plan_reminder": false, "cmd": ["/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/213fdca795ed7a3cf6ee62642ea809f074b7a583/omp", "-p", "Add retry with backoff (3 attempts) to `WeatherClient.get` when the server returns 503.\n", "--mode", "json", "--provider", "vertex-anthropic", "--model", "claude-opus-5-5", "--yolo", "--session-dir", "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step7-opus-1019-S7C/omp-30/transcripts/with/trig-omp-netclient/27/session"], "completed": true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 1, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "final_workspace": "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step7-opus-1019-S7C/omp-30/cells/with/trig-omp-netclient/27/workspace", "first_after_build": false, "first_side": "without", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "omp/16.2.8 (/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/213fdca795ed7a3cf6ee62642ea809f074b7a583/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "Smoke test against a real local server returning 503 twice, then 200; plus always-503 and 500 cases.\n`WeatherClient.get` in `weather.py` now retries when the server returns 503, making up to 3 attempts in total. I tested it against a real local HTTP server and it behaves as intended.\n\n**How it works:**\n- A 503 makes `urllib` raise an `HTTPError`. If attempts remain, the client closes that error response, waits, and tries again.\n- The waits double each time: 0.5s after the first failure, then 1.0s after the second.\n- If all 3 attempts get a 503, the last `HTTPError` is raised as before, so callers see the same error type they did before this change.\n- Other HTTP errors, such as a 500, are raised straight away without retrying. Network errors and timeouts are not retried either; I left them out because you only asked about 503.\n- Two new constructor settings control this: `max_attempts=3` and `backoff=0.5`. The defaults give the behaviour above, so existing calls don't need to change.\n\n**Test results** (with the waits stubbed out so they don't slow the test):\n\n| Scenario | Requests | Sleeps | Result |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 503, 503, 200 | 3 | [0.5, 1.0] | returns `{'temp': 21}` |\n| always 503 | 3 | [0.5, 1.0] | raises `HTTPError` 503 |\n| 500 | 1 | [] | raises `HTTPError` 500 |\n\nThe project had no test suite, so I didn't add a test file; the test above was a one-off script.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 2, "replies_ok": 6, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 104445, "requests_cache_write": 107892, "requests_cost_usd": 0.600765, "requests_count": 6, "requests_input_uncached": 14, "requests_output": 2018, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-netclient:claude-opus-5-5:trial27", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 113, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-20T03:52:22.542794+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "